      "availability": "Closure initializer iOS13+ in SDK27.",
      "reviewedOn": "2026-11-05"
    },
    {
      "id": "rotors",
      "url": "https://developer.apple.com/documentation/uikit/uiaccessibilitycustomrotor",
      "section": "Overview; itemSearchBlock; UIAccessibilityCustomRotor.h",
